infographic sequence-snake-steps-underline-text
data
  title Composition is not addition: one failure cascade
  desc Each mechanism behaves exactly as its unit taught — the failure lives in the chain
  sequences
    - label Retry storm builds
      desc Idempotency makes one retry safe; multiplied across the fleet it becomes a storm.
    - label Pool exhausts
      desc Bounded connections run out; the pool's correct response is to make callers wait.
    - label Breaker trips
      desc That waiting reads as a slow dependency, so the circuit breaker opens.
    - label Load reshaped
      desc Tripping changes the load the retry layer sees — feeding back to step 1.
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
